d","supersedes":[],"text":"Calendar creation panels expose Fluent button-label and access-key attributes that updateButton reads into the shared dialog buttons. The network location input also exposes both placeholder and default-placeholder; fillLocationPlaceholder restores the custom default when no nonempty username domain is available. These attribute lists preserve named JavaScript consumers. The migration retains this panel-metadata design rather than rewriting it.","title":"Calendar creation Fluent attributes retain their JavaScript consumers","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
